These are the dual monitor patches for linux 0.99pl10,
they will not work with any earlier kernel release.

These kernel patches allow you to use both VGA and MONO
video cards in your computer, and view consoles on both
at the same time.  As of the previous release of these
patches, you are able to assign which console is visible
on which monitor at run time, by using the left and right
