following subject lines are recognized:

SUBJECT                           ACTION
------------------------ ----------------------------------------------
help                     mails you an updated version of this file
help-linux               mails you instructions for Sunsite's mail help
help-meta                mails you the Linux META-FAQ
help-uucp                mails you the UUCP-NEWS-MAIL-FAQ 
mail-order               mails you summary of mail order companies
mail-order <Company #'s> mails information about a specific company
Xconfig-file             mails you a list of Xconfig files available
Xconfig-file <File #'s>  mails you a specific Xconfig file
<anything else>          forwards your message to Bill C. Riemers
------------------------ ----------------------------------------------
NOTE: If your mail server does not support a subject line, send a message
with the key-word SUBJECT: followed by one of the above subjects. i.e.:

Subject: help

