ANSWER: The old xmkmf under Linux doesn't like # comments in Imakefiles. 
Therefore you must change the #'s to XCOMM. But be careful. Don't change
any pre-compiler directives. (mal11@po.CWRU.Edu  Matthew A. Lewis)

